    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Simple Yet Deep High-Speed Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience exhilarating shooting action with intuitive FPS controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, dodge, and power up as you fight to survive against relentless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Endless Strategies Born from Growth and Randomness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to level up! Enhance your core stats and skills to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, choose one of three randomly selected items. The path to power is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden treasure chests on the map to acquire even more items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special items obtained from bosses will further turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Builds That Change Every Playthrough</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items come with powerful unique effects and appear randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat boosts, explosive chain reactions, recoil reduction\u2014your playstyle will shift dramatically based on the items you find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tactics and strategy to survive as long as possible and achieve the highest score!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Simple Yet Deep High-Speed Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience exhilarating shooting action with intuitive FPS controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, dodge, and power up as you fight to survive against relentless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Endless Strategies Born from Growth and Randomness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to level up! Enhance your core stats and skills to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, choose one of three randomly selected items. The path to power is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden treasure chests on the map to acquire even more items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special items obtained from bosses will further turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Builds That Change Every Playthrough</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items come with powerful unique effects and appear randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat boosts, explosive chain reactions, recoil reduction\u2014your playstyle will shift dramatically based on the items you find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tactics and strategy to survive as long as possible and achieve the highest score!</p>",
